    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d440">

                <pb facs="0324" n="252" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg252"/>

                <head>Inhabitants of Limerick</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Town Hall</hi>, <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Limerick</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-09">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 9, 1865</date>.</dateline>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: At a public meeting held in this city on
                    Saturday, the 6th instant, to express the opinion of the citizens of Limerick on
                    the assassination of President Lincoln and the attempt on the life of Mr.
                    Seward, a series of resolutions were passed unanimously, and which I now
                    enclose, with a request that you will have copies sent to Mrs. Lincoln, also to
                    Mr. Seward.</p>
                <p>Assuring you of my own feeling of sympathy with the American people, and
                    abhorrence of the cowardly act which has been committed,</p>
                <p>I have the honor to remain your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN R. TINSLEY,</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mayor of Limerick</hi>.</closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps"> C. F. Adams</hi>, <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">United States Minister, London</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d440-a1.xml" xpointer="d440-a1"/>
            </div>
